<title>UK: UK June consumer credit up 1.275 bln stg in June.</title>
<headline>UK June consumer credit up 1.275 bln stg in June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK consumer credit grew by a net s/a 1.275 billion stg in June, after a revised 1.226 billion stg increase in May, Bank of England data showed.</p>
<p>The bank said June's consumer credit growth was the highest since the monthly series began in 1993.  </p>
<p>Following are June consumer credit data - (previously released data in brackets, in MLN STG)</p>
<p>				 June	  May	   June 96</p>
<p>TOTAL NET LENDING	   3,148	3,421(3,127)  2,101</p>
<p>  -- Consumer credit	1,275	1,226 (1,105)   644</p>
<p>  -- Secured on dwellings 1,872	2,194(2,022)   1,457</p>
<p>BREAKDOWN of net consumer lending BY SOURCE -</p>
<p>  -- Banks		    1,135   1,017 (903)    208</p>
<p>  -- Building societies	-2     15   (18)     34</p>
<p>  -- Other spec lenders     137     166 (139)    407</p>
<p>  -- Retailers		   18	30  (30)     -6</p>
<p>  -- Insurers		   -13	-2  (15)	1</p>
<p>CREDIT CARD		     250     324 (307)    199</p>
<p>CONSUMER CREDIT (seasonally adjusted, in PCT)</p>
<p> Total personal borrowing mth/mth  0.6    0.7 (0.6)  0.5</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;	  &quot;    3mth/3mth 7.9    7.6 (7.0)  6.1</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;	  &quot;     yr/yr    7.4    7.2 (7.0)  5.5</p>
<p> Consumer credit mth/mth	     1.6    1.6 (1.4)  0.9</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;     3mth/3mth	  19.6  17.1  (15.3)15.6</p>
<p>   &quot;	 &quot;     yr/yr		18.3  17.6 (17.0) 14.4</p>
<p>Secured on dwellings mth/mth  0.4 0.5 (0.5)  0.4</p>
<p>			     3mth/3mth 5.9 5.9 (5.5) 4.6</p>
<p>			     yr/yr     5.5 5.4 (5.3) 4.1</p>
